# App runtime config (desktop/mobile read these at runtime; web pairs on /pair).
# Unset = public dev defaults for the local mock gateway. Nothing is compiled in.
# DTAP_GATEWAY_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
# DTAP_TERMINAL_TOKEN=   # outside mock mode: 32+ random chars, e.g. `openssl rand -hex 32`

# Gateway process environment. `make gateway` sets DTAP_MOCK=1.
DTAP_MOCK=1
DTAP_BIND=127.0.0.1:8787
DTAP_CORS_ORIGINS=http://127.0.0.1:8080,http://localhost:8080

# Optional. Not required to compile or start, and never read by dtap-app.
# Mock mode is on when DTAP_MOCK=1, or when these are absent and DTAP_MOCK is unset.
# Real BTCPay wiring is not implemented. /health will not report blackvault until it is.
# BTCPAY_URL=
# BTCPAY_API_KEY=
# BTCPAY_STORE_ID=
